=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ GREP @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU grep @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU grep is free software under the GNU GPL, version 3 or later.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [GREP.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU grep
GREP$ROOT has been defined for the running system.  To define it at every
boot, add this line to SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM, using the directory
where grep was installed:

    $ @<destination>:[GREP]GREP$STARTUP.COM

Users define the grep, egrep and fgrep commands with:

    $ @GREP$ROOT:[000000]GREP$SETUP.COM
